  "description": "Production ASP.NET Core PII masking and redaction middleware for SecureRedact (.NET 8 & 10). Automatically intercepts and redacts sensitive PII (Credit Cards, PAN, Aadhaar, SSN, IBAN, Email, Phone) in JSON HTTP requests and responses with chunked/HTTP2 support, fail-closed 413 payload limits, IConfiguration appsettings binding, and non-blocking CPU concurrency backpressure (HTTP 503).",
